# The Missing Piece (outlands 193) with its era module, modules/era/lua/quests/outlands/the_missing_piece.lua, enabled
# by xi.pre(SOA) (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_SOA 0): 703's finish runs the base handler, then Wait = JstMidnight()
# (1800025200, the next JST midnight after the harness clock; the base alone sets 1800000060: the trace's char var shows
# which). A level 10 Warrior in Northern San d'Oria, accepted at Prog 2 with the tablet and the letter (GMs).
# Charlaimagnat 703, finished: the title, the key items taken, Prog 3, Wait 1800025200; 704; Wait 1800025199 is not set
# here (the clock does not move between steps): `wait jst=1` (past JST midnight): 705, finished: completed.
module modules/era/lua/quests/outlands/the_missing_piece.lua
lists NorthernSanDoria/Charlaimagnat/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/703 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/705
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=127.703,6.499,109.316 job=WAR lvl=10
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
quest Outlands.TheMissingPiece accepted
charvar Quest[5][193]Prog 2
keyitem TabletOfAncientMagic
keyitem LetterFromAlfesar
login
trigger Charlaimagnat                   # Prog 2: 703
finish                                  # the base: Wait +60, the title, the key items taken, Prog 3; the module: Wait = JstMidnight
trigger Charlaimagnat                   # now < Wait: 704
finish
wait jst=1                              # past JST midnight
trigger Charlaimagnat                   # 705
finish                                  # completed: the scroll; fame
